--TEST--
a stored property added to a `Core\Time` value class, to an interface or to an enum is `E1014` at the property, and a property with only a `get` hook on the same types compiles (`rule:classes/an-added-property-lives-in-one-hidden-slot`)
--FILE--
<?nvs
namespace Shop;

extend Core\Time\Date as DateNotes {
    public ?string $note = null;

    public bool $isFirst {
        get => $this->day() == 1;
    }
}

extend Core\Router\Gate as GateNotes {
    public string $label = "";
}

extend Core\Time\Weekday as DayNotes {
    public int $count = 0;
}
// covers: lang:classes/extend-blocks
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E1014]: `Core\Time\Date` cannot store a property an `extend` block adds
%A
error[E1014]: `Core\Router\Gate` cannot store a property an `extend` block adds
%A
error[E1014]: `Core\Time\Weekday` cannot store a property an `extend` block adds
%A
error: aborting due to 3 errors
